<title>SINGAPORE: Tye Soon hits S$0.55 high on debut.</title>
<headline>Tye Soon hits S$0.55 high on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share price for Tye Soon Ltd reached a high of Singapore $0.55 early Monday, a 77 percent premium over its initial public offer (IPO) level.  </p>
<p>Volume was a brisk 19.2 million shares after about 30 minutes of trade.</p>
<p>The public portion of automotive component distributor Tye Soon's share offer for its IPO had been 70.6 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The public portion comprised 41.89 million shares at Singapore $0.31 each.</p>
<p>The placement portion of 17.95 million shares was also fully taken up.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
